{"id":"355f225c96e5595e","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-feynman-kac-pde.md","title":"Feynman–Kac PDE Connection","display":"thm-feynman-kac-pde — Feynman–Kac PDE Connection","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-feynman-kac-pde","aliases":["58-thm-feynman-kac-pde"],"display":"thm-feynman-kac-pde — Feynman–Kac PDE Connection","depends_on":["[[58-df-brownian]]","[[58-df-pde]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-feynman-kac-pde"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-feynman-kac-pde</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-feynman-kac-pde — Feynman–Kac PDE Connection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8fc074624288fbbb\" href=\"?note=8fc074624288fbbb\" title=\"58-df-brownian\">58-df-brownian</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cfebb2fc4b84c8f\" href=\"?note=9cfebb2fc4b84c8f\" title=\"58-df-pde\">58-df-pde</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,L,q,f,u\\in V\">\\(X,L,q,f,u\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0}\">\\(X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0}\\)</span> is a diffusion on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> with generator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,f:E\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(q,f:E\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> is bounded below, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> is bounded and continuous, and the classical Feynman--Kac regularity hypotheses hold so that the displayed expectation is finite and differentiation under the expectation is valid</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> belongs to the time-space domain of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial_t-L+q\">\\(\\partial_t-L+q\\)</span> and is continuous at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=0\">\\(t=0\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac\\text{-}pde} \\vdash \\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\left(u(t,x)=\\mathbb E^x\\!\\left[e^{-\\int_0^tq(X_s)\\,ds}f(X_t)\\right]\\right)\\to\\left(\\partial_tu=Lu-qu\\land\\forall x\\in E\\;(u(0,x)=f(x))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac\\text{-}pde} \\vdash \\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\left(u(t,x)=\\mathbb E^x\\!\\left[e^{-\\int_0^tq(X_s)\\,ds}f(X_t)\\right]\\right)\\to\\left(\\partial_tu=Lu-qu\\land\\forall x\\in E\\;(u(0,x)=f(x))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The regularity and generator assumptions are theorem context, not arbitrary undeclared predicates whose interpretation could make the implication vacuous.</li>\n<li>Under those assumptions, Feynman–Kac represents the solution of the backward equation associated with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> and killing potential <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The sign of the potential term is fixed by the exponential factor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{-\\int q(X_s)ds}\">\\(e^{-\\int q(X_s)ds}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-brownian","status":"resolved","id":"8fc074624288fbbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-brownian]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-pde","status":"resolved","id":"9cfebb2fc4b84c8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-pde]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d","display":false},{"tex":"X,L,q,f,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"q,f:E\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial_t-L+q","display":false},{"tex":"t=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}feynman\\text{-}kac\\text{-}pde} \\vdash \\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in E\\;\\left(u(t,x)=\\mathbb E^x\\!\\left[e^{-\\int_0^tq(X_s)\\,ds}f(X_t)\\right]\\right)\\to\\left(\\partial_tu=Lu-qu\\land\\forall x\\in E\\;(u(0,x)=f(x))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"e^{-\\int q(X_s)ds}","display":false}],"bytes":1458,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-feynman-kac-pde.md|58-thm-feynman-kac-pde]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["8fc074624288fbbb","9cfebb2fc4b84c8f"]}